<view class="page-shell folder-editor"><page-nav title="{{id ? '编辑相册' : '新建相册'}}"></page-nav><view class="editor-card card"><view class="field-label">相册名称（可选）</view><input class="text-input" placeholder="留空时默认为“回忆集”" maxlength="20" value="{{name}}" bindinput="input"/><view class="field-note">可建立多个相册，相同名称也可以重复使用。</view><view class="field-label">相册封面（可选）</view><view wx:if="{{cover}}" class="picked-image"><image src="{{cover}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><view class="cover-actions"><view class="replace-image tap" bindtap="chooseCover">更换封面</view><view class="remove-cover tap" bindtap="clearCover">移除</view></view></view><view wx:else class="image-picker tap" bindtap="chooseCover"><view class="image-plus">▰</view><view>选择一张本地图片作为封面</view><text>不选择也可以直接创建</text></view></view><view class="editor-actions"><button wx:if="{{id}}" class="delete-button" bindtap="remove">删除相册</button><button class="btn-primary save-button" bindtap="save">保存相册</button></view></view>
